      }
    },
    "仅用于截图翻译：按下快捷键时截取屏幕画面用于定格框选，在本机识别选区中的文字，截图不保存也不上传；开启后需按系统提示重新打开 OI" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only for Screen Translation: when you press the shortcut, the screen is captured and frozen for selection, and text in the selection is recognized on this Mac. Screenshots are never saved or uploaded. After turning it on, reopen OI when macOS asks you to"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用于截图翻译：按下快捷键时截取屏幕画面用于定格框选，在本机识别选区中的文字，截图不保存也不上传；开启后需按系统提示重新打开 OI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后再说" : {
