    "停止朗读（⌘⇧S）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop Speaking (⌘⇧S)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止朗读（⌘⇧S）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全局呼出启动器面板的快捷键，需包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃ 修饰键；只用 ⌘ 时仅限 Space 与 F 键，以免覆盖各应用的同名快捷键。点按录制后按 Esc 取消。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The global shortcut that opens the launcher. It must include ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃; with ⌘ alone, only Space and function keys are allowed, so it doesn’t override the same shortcut in other apps. Click to record; press Esc to cancel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全局呼出启动器面板的快捷键，需包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃ 修饰键；只用 ⌘ 时仅限 Space 与 F 键，以免覆盖各应用的同名快捷键。点按录制后按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
