    "原快捷键重新注册也失败，当前没有可用的%@快捷键（新组合原因：%@）。请重新录制组合或重启 OI" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Re-registering the previous shortcut also failed, so no %@ shortcut works right now (new combination: %@). Record a combination again or restart OI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
