    "原文已是目标语言时译为" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Already in Target Language, Translate To"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原文已是目标语言时译为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文译为目标语言，原文已是目标语言时改译为第二项；默认按系统语言选定，如中文系统为外文译简体中文、中文译英语。气泡中可临时切换本次翻译的目标语言。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Text is translated into the target language; text already in the target language is translated into the second language instead. The defaults follow your system language: in English, other languages are translated into English and English into Simplified Chinese. You can change the target language of a single translation in the bubble."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原文译为目标语言，原文已是目标语言时改译为第二项；默认按系统语言选定，如中文系统为外文译简体中文、中文译英语。气泡中可临时切换本次翻译的目标语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
