    "在「光标与点按」中把「查询与数据检测器」改为「用三个手指轻点」或关闭，避免系统词典与翻译气泡同时弹出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Point & Click, set “Look up & data detectors” to “Tap with Three Fingers” or turn it off, so the dictionary doesn’t pop up along with the translation bubble"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「光标与点按」中把「查询与数据检测器」改为「用三个手指轻点」或关闭，避免系统词典与翻译气泡同时弹出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在启动器中按 Tab 进入 Quick AI，输入问题后按回车提问。兼容 OpenAI Chat Completions 接口，也可填写 Ollama 等本地服务（如 http://localhost:11434/v1）。提问内容会发送到所填地址，API Key 保存在钥匙串中。思考强度对应接口的 reasoning_effort 参数，常见取值为 low、medium、high，各服务支持的取值不同；留空则不发送，不支持该参数的服务可能报错。「获取模型」与「测试连接」用当前填写的地址与 API Key 读取服务的模型列表，不发送提问。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the launcher, press Tab to enter Quick AI, type a question and press Return. Works with OpenAI Chat Completions–compatible APIs, including local services such as Ollama (for example http://localhost:11434/v1). Questions are sent to the base URL you enter, and the API key is stored in the Keychain. Reasoning Effort maps to the API’s reasoning_effort parameter; common values are low, medium and high, and supported values vary by service. Leave it empty to omit it; services that don’t support it may return an error. Fetch Models and Test Connection read the service’s model list with the current base URL and API key, without sending any question."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在启动器中按 Tab 进入 Quick AI，输入问题后按回车提问。兼容 OpenAI Chat Completions 接口，也可填写 Ollama 等本地服务（如 http://localhost:11434/v1）。提问内容会发送到所填地址，API Key 保存在钥匙串中。思考强度对应接口的 reasoning_effort 参数，常见取值为 low、medium、high，各服务支持的取值不同；留空则不发送，不支持该参数的服务可能报错。「获取模型」与「测试连接」用当前填写的地址与 API Key 读取服务的模型列表，不发送提问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
