    },
    "翻译接口与 Quick AI 分开填写，可以使用不同的服务与模型，建议选用响应快、不带思考的模型，或把思考强度设低（含义同 Quick AI）；原文会发送到所填地址，API Key 保存在钥匙串中。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The translation API is set separately from Quick AI, so it can use a different service and model. A fast model without reasoning works best, or set Reasoning Effort low (same meaning as in Quick AI). Text to translate is sent to the base URL you enter, and the API key is stored in the Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译接口与 Quick AI 分开填写，可以使用不同的服务与模型，建议选用响应快、不带思考的模型，或把思考强度设低（含义同 Quick AI）；原文会发送到所填地址，API Key 保存在钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
